les","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p062","quote":"澹臺滅明，武城人，字子羽。少孔子三十九歳。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m062-0000"}],"interpretation_note":"按傳首或本段明示原地名保存，不將籍貫、居所、遷移與死亡地互換；傳授鏈每人各存來源地，不推共同到訪。未知年月與現代位置不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},{"id":"pa-shiji067-011","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","relation":"migration_destination","place":{"source_name":"江","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"南遊至江","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p064","quote":"南遊至江，從弟子三百人，設取予去就，名施乎諸侯。孔子聞之，曰：「吾以言取人，失之宰予；以貌取人，失之子羽。」","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0050"}],"interpretation_note":"按傳首或本段明示原地名保存，不將籍貫、居所、遷移與死亡地互換；傳授鏈每人各存來源地，不推共同到訪。未知年月與現代位置不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji067-052","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-067-disciples"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["子羽","澹臺滅明"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p062","quote":"澹臺滅明，武城人，字子羽。少孔子三十九歳。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p064","quote":"南遊至江，從弟子三百人，設取予去就，名施乎諸侯。孔子聞之，曰：「吾以言取人，失之宰予；以貌取人，失之子羽。」"}],"rationale":"依篇內明示姓名字稱及局部問答暫接。吳越王稱按夫差句踐連續敘事；第71段夫子指原憲，第90段指代未定。傳易短何分田子莊何與楊何，傳授不當父子；引古人物保留傳說性。冉季字子產不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。"},{"id":"d-shiji121-scholars-03","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","surfaces":["澹臺子羽"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-121-rulin","c-shiji-067-disciples"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-shiji-121-rulin:m002-0049"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-121","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p002","quote":"自孔子卒後，七十子之徒散游諸侯，大者為師傅卿相，小者友教士大夫，或隱而不見。故子路居衛，子張居陳，澹臺子羽居楚，子夏居西河，子貢終於齊。如田子方、段干木、吳起、禽滑釐之屬，皆受業於子夏之倫，為王者師。是時獨魏文侯好學。后陵遲以至于始皇，天下并爭於戰國，懦術既絀焉，然齊魯之閒，學者獨不廢也。於威、宣之際，孟子、荀卿之列，咸遵夫子之業而潤色之，以學顯於當世。"},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-067","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p062","quote":"澹臺滅明，武城人，字子羽。少孔子三十九歳。"}],"rationale":"澹臺子羽屬孔門弟子；弟子篇明書澹臺滅明字子羽。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p062","text":"澹臺滅明，武城人，字子羽。少孔子三十九歳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m062-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"澹臺滅明","kind":"person","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m062-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"子羽","kind":"person","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m062-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p064","text":"南遊至江，從弟子三百人，設取予去就，名施乎諸侯。孔子聞之，曰：「吾以言取人，失之宰予；以貌取人，失之子羽。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"弟子三百人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名、成員或親屬；譬喻與未遂取室不作已確證家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名、成員或親屬；譬喻與未遂取室不作已確證家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","perso